<title>USA: Pittston Brink's unit acquires affiliate.</title>
<headline>Pittston Brink's unit acquires affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>DARIEN, Conn. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brink's Inc said Friday a subsidiary completed the acquisition of the remaining one-third of its affiliated company in Hong Kong, Brink's-HKS Ltd.</p>
<p>Brink's Inc is a unit of the Pittston Brink's Group,</p>
<p>The shares were acquired from a former joint venture partner, which was a subsidiary of Jardine Pacific Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
